{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919140/extras/b92e1528d105f34b271b6976d5d80e83.avif?t=1755525131\" width=1600 height=1015 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sous Raccoon</strong> is an Action-Roguelike Defense game where you play as a raccoon sous chef assistant. You'll embark on a journey to open restaurants in various locations, with the head chef spending 7 days at each location before moving to the next. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your duties include handling <strong>everything</strong> within the restaurant: Taking and Delivering orders, gathering ingredients, and serving food to customers. But that's not all \u2013 you must also protect customers from attacking monsters. If you fail in your mission, you'll be fired and have to start all over again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919140/extras/e35501a6b78b04e1dd885a2996688866.avif?t=1755525131\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Gameplay</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat System</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Healing System</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cooking System</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skill System</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each day, birds will appear for players to defeat in order to earn gold coins. These coins can be used to purchase skills that are randomly offered to players for selection each day.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Random Event System</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every day, there's a chance for special events to occur that will either increase or decrease the difficulty of your gameplay experience.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Upgrade &amp; Skin System</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the game ends, whether you win or lose, the tips that players earned during stages can be used to upgrade characters or purchase skins outside of gameplay stages.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Wellcome to Raccoon City","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3919140/6c2e02c0958dc6f67fc316f00d48fca01cbea847.jpg"}],"total":1},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3919140?t=1755525131","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919140/35c8bde2841ad43715d481710472ea4edba76073/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755525131","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919140/f42051e504cefe3af7d16d8cd06e2bfd1d65e0a1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755525131","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919140/f42051e504cefe3af7d16d8cd06e2bfd1d65e0a1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755525131","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919140/extras/2d7d4b26358b97cf9da9e06b451048c7.avif?t=1755525131\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919140/extras/b92e1528d105f34b271b6976d5d80e83.avif?t=1755525131\" width=1600 height=1015 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sous Raccoon</strong> is an Action-Roguelike Defense game where you play as a raccoon sous chef assistant. You'll embark on a journey to open restaurants in various locations, with the head chef spending 7 days at each location before moving to the next. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your duties include handling <strong>everything</strong> within the restaurant: Taking and Delivering orders, gathering ingredients, and serving food to customers. But that's not all \u2013 you must also protect customers from attacking monsters. If you fail in your mission, you'll be fired and have to start all over again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919140/extras/e35501a6b78b04e1dd885a2996688866.avif?t=1755525131\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Gameplay</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat System</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Healing System</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cooking System</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skill System</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each day, birds will appear for players to defeat in order to earn gold coins. These coins can be used to purchase skills that are randomly offered to players for selection each day.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Random Event System</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every day, there's a chance for special events to occur that will either increase or decrease the difficulty of your gameplay experience.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Upgrade &amp; Skin System</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the game ends, whether you win or lose, the tips that players earned during stages can be used to upgrade characters or purchase skins outside of gameplay stages.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Novice Flow"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919140/49c92a8e5f56ab4f952e49b76063f4ee1c220a12/header.jpg?t=1755525131","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3919140/1622465151/2bcd7ffd9f6eaf6362cc3d7d9307be0d30d02a29/1753985685/dash_av1.mpd?t=1754335658","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3919140/1622465151/2bcd7ffd9f6eaf6362cc3d7d9307be0d30d02a29/1753985685/dash_h264.mpd?t=1754335658","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3919140/1622465151/2bcd7ffd9f6eaf6362cc3d7d9307be0d30d02a29/1753985685/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1754335658","id":257176389,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257176389/movie480.mp4?t=1754335658","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257176389/movie_max.mp4?t=1754335658"},"name":"Sous Raccoon Teaser 1","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257176389/da43e26e2c6a17756ec05ef4a1241cc92e0ab590/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1754335658","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257176389/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1754335658","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257176389/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1754335658"}}],"name":"Sou